  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dc66e9658df9284f81f0664a7ee2889, type: 3}
  m_Name: ReedGraveyardCollectible
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CollectableEntries
  entryTitle: A Note from Reed
  description: 
  neutralDescription: "After not seeing Echo in a while, they\u2019re seemingly still
    the same. It\u2019s always been hard to tell exactly what they\u2019re thinking
    or feeling. Some things don\u2019t change, I guess. They\u2019re still doing
    me a big favor by cleaning up the leaves, maybe I\u2019ll teach them to drive
    or something."
  negativeDescription: "I was never that close with Echo\u2026but were they always
    a \u201Cmeans to an end\u201D kind of person? I can appreciate that they\u2019re
    cleaning the leaves for me, but they dozed off while I was being vulnerable.
    Maybe my timing was weird. I guess I owe them something\u2026"
  positiveDescription: "Man, Echo\u2019s a lifesaver. To think they\u2019d be willing
    to clean the leaves even though we aren\u2019t exactly \u201Cfriends\u201D. I\u2019ve
    got to get my s#*% together. I miss Darry, but I can\u2019t let it keep me down
    after all this time. What can I do to thank Echo?"
